# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Commits are made from SourceTree on Windows over \\wsl$; without this, CRLF
# leaks into the working tree and every tracked file shows as modified with an
# empty diff, which hides real changes rather than merely being untidy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
